DESCRIPTION:Authority: Missouri Governor\nReason: President Donald J. Trump has ordered the flag to be flown at half-staff in honor of all fallen service members.\nSource: https://oa.mo.gov/facilities/facilities-operations/flag-display/flag-notifications
